(WCAG 2.5.7) and a new dependency."}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_22_generality_size_importance_visibility", "label": "Decision 22 \u2014 Generality sizes circle, importance sets zoom visibility", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md", "source_location": "L442", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_23_dependencies_not_bundles", "label": "Decision 23 \u2014 Many drafts, dependencies instead of bundles", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md", "source_location": "L469", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reviewers judge one idea at a time; a disputed concept can't hold an uncontroversial one hostage."}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_24_depth_by_zoom", "label": "Decision 24 \u2014 Depth by zoom", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md", "source_location": "L490", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_25_github_app_opens_proposals", "label": "Decision 25 \u2014 A GitHub App opens proposals; people only sign in", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md", "source_location": "L513", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Repo stays private; collaborators could push, forks need read access \u2014 an App writes on behalf of signed-in proposers."}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_26_topic_layer_retired", "label": "Decision 26 \u2014 Topic layer retired; concept map is the whole site", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DESIGN-DECISIONS.md", "source_location": "L539", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_decisions_decision_27_line_takes_larger_attributes", "label": "Decision 27 \u2014 A relation's li